    "title": "View cones",
    "description": "<div><p>This dataset contains the boundaries of the City's protected views.  Development within the polygons is limited in height to maintain these public views. </p><p>\n<strong>Note:</strong> To understand view cone implications on individual sites, please email <a href=\"mailto:views@vancouver.caviews@vancouver.ca\">views@vancouver.ca</a></p></div> <h3>Data currency</h3><div><p>The extract for this dataset is updated as needed. There may be no change in data content from one week to the next because there is no change in source data. Priorities and resources will also determine how fast a change in reality is reflected in the database.  </p></div> <h3>Data accuracy</h3><div><p>These view corridors have been entered accurately, but the authoritative source for these is the City's bylaws.</p></div> <h3>Websites for further information</h3><div><ul><li>\n<a href=\"https://vancouver.ca/your-government/vanmap.aspx\">VanMap - View Cones </a></li><li>\n<a href=\"http://vancouver.ca/home-property-development/protecting-vancouvers-views.aspx\">Protecting Vancouver's views</a></li></ul></div>",
    "sha256_geojson": "843383585c4a732ed18f9624628651b7aaa478cb195cfc1e8a3ef2aefd215980",
    "crs": "GeoJSON export, WGS84 longitude/latitude (EPSG:4326) as served by the portal",
    "portal_caveat_verbatim": "The extract for this dataset is updated as needed. There may be no change in data content from one week to the next because there is no change in source data. (portal description)",
    "use_in_tool": "plan outlines of the view cones and candidate origin positions, mapped into model coordinates with the checked earth-anchor transformation; the heights of the horizontal lower boundaries are NOT in this dataset unless a field says so",
    "city_view_pages": {
      "status": "listed in the dataset's url field; automated access returned HTTP 403 (Cloudflare) on 2026-09-23, so they were NOT read",
      "verification_needed": "Origin elevations and cone height data have not been verified against the per-view pages; no height data from those pages is used here."
    },
    "heights": "The dataset holds plan polygons only. No maximum geodetic heights, no origin elevations, no datum statement. The tool therefore never uses a City height; the guideline check runs on a user-declared hypothetical boundary."
